#   (0xc1 would shift by 16; 0x81 by 32), bits 2..6 or 2..7 signed (0x85 would shift by 1; 0x81 by -32), bit 7 as a
#   bias-off flag (0x81 kept its bias). Each fails on at least one of
#   0x81, 0x85 and 0xc1. UNEXPLAINED.
